## Monorepo (always)

- FE app: `apps/web`
- Shared UI: `packages/ui` → import `@repo/ui/*` (no deep cross-package imports)
- API contract types/keys: `@repo/api` — see [shared](../shared/shared-rules-index.mdc)
- Full monorepo layout: [shared turbo-workspace](../shared/rules/turbo-workspace.mdc)

## Sub-agents (15 specialists + coordinator)

Registry: [agents/README.md](./agents/README.md). Task recipes: [agents/coordinator/AGENTS.md](./agents/coordinator/AGENTS.md).

| Agent | Use for |
| --- | --- |
| repo-scanner, feature, architecture, dependency | Discovery & scope |
| route, component, state, api, validation, i18n | Implementation areas |
| performance, bug-reproduction | Perf & bugs |
| test, quality-gates | Tests & CI |
| reviewer | **Last** — patch review |

## Complex task protocol

For refactors, performance, bugs, new features, forms, or i18n:

1. Read [agents/WORKFLOW.md](./agents/WORKFLOW.md) — pick tier; use checklist
2. Read [agents/coordinator/AGENTS.md](./agents/coordinator/AGENTS.md) — recipes & ownership
3. Run sub-agents via Task tool with **scoped paths** (feature [manifests](./agents/feature/manifests/)); max agents per tier
4. Follow [_shared/output-contract.md](./agents/_shared/output-contract.md) — cite evidence; use `INSUFFICIENT_CONTEXT` instead of guessing
5. After implementation: **quality-gates** (lint, types, **build**) → **reviewer** last (severity on issues)

## Always apply (summary)

- **I18N:** User-facing strings in EN + JA — see [rules/fe-i18n.mdc](./rules/fe-i18n.mdc)
- **Layers:** `APP → FEATURES → SHARED → CORE → UI` — see [rules/fe-import-boundaries.mdc](./rules/fe-import-boundaries.mdc)
- **Principles:** KISS, YAGNI, DRY; no `any`; Zod for user input
- **Quality:** `pnpm lint`, `pnpm check-types`, Knip, tests, build — see [rules/fe-quality-gates.mdc](./rules/fe-quality-gates.mdc)

## Implementation checklist

1. Import boundaries respected
2. File in correct layer
3. kebab-case files, PascalCase components
4. Zod for user input
5. Feature public API via `features/<name>/index.ts`
6. Loading / error / empty states + a11y
7. Shared UI from `@repo/ui` when cross-app
8. Reviewer agent after non-trivial changes; quality-gates before reviewer when feasible
9. Feature work: [rules/fe-feature-module.mdc](./rules/fe-feature-module.mdc); mutations: [rules/fe-server-actions.mdc](./rules/fe-server-actions.mdc)

